# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# The four-stage Python example of examples/ala3 (#82) at a tiny scale on
# a GPU in mixed precision, its default: minimization, NVT from drawn
# velocities, NPT with restraints, and production with an energy file, a
# DCD trajectory, and a callback.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/../../examples/ala3/run.py --steps-scale 0.0002 --out %t | FileCheck %s
# RUN: grep -vc '^#' %t/md.dat | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ROWS
# RUN: test -s %t/md.dcd && test -s %t/nvt.dat && test -s %t/npt.dat
# CHECK: 1-min: 10 steps in {{.*}} kcal/mol
# CHECK: 2-nvt: 10 steps in {{.*}} density
# CHECK: 3-npt: 10 steps in {{.*}} density
# CHECK: step 10: density
# CHECK: 4-md: 100 steps in {{.*}} density
# CHECK: 4-md: mean density {{[0-9.]+}} g/cm^3 over 10 reports
# ROWS: {{^}}11{{$}}
